f-b189-4d074f562d14\",\"old_source_id\":\"parse:90c62150-979a-47b1-be91-4985ae1d7307\"}],\"analysis_protocol\":{\"instruction\":\"Return one impact-response-v2 JSON object using this response_schema. The saved call owns the current unit; do not output a unit, UUID or hash. Use only short references in fixed_references: S for sources, P for segments, C for cases, D for differences. For action=read supply short references/ranges with no final outcome or candidates; for finish supply unit_outcome/candidates/unresolved with no pending reads. Discovery candidates cite exact supplied original slices; positions are original character offsets, not normalized diff offsets. Case citations use literal JSON paths and actual values from a complete case supplied in this message history. Catalogs are not read evidence. During coordination stage case_impacts, candidates are BoundRuleCaseAssessment objects with rule_ref R1 etc. and case_impacts; assess every fixed rule for the current complete case. The server preserves the fixed rule body and binds identities/hashes before fact checks. Canonical identities mentioned in coordination instructions are internal; this response_schema defines the model reply. Do not rewrite those identities or copy hashes. Request fixed reads for cross-section/missing evidence. Keep intentional negative conditions. Applicability is a suggestion, deployment unknown, all candidates pending review. Do not claim full project coverage or execute/change official records.\",\"response_schema\":{\"$defs\":{\"BoundCaseCandidate\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^C[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Case Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"citations\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCitation\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Citations\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"none\",\"minor\",\"major\",\"uncertain\"],\"title\":\"Level\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Reason\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"verification_points\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":\"Verification Points\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"case_ref\",\"level\",\"reason\",\"citations\"],\"title\":\"BoundCaseCandidate\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundCaseCitation\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"items\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"integer\"}]},\"title\":\"Path\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"root\":{\"default\":\"content_json\",\"enum\":[\"content_json\",\"execution_notes\"],\"title\":\"Root\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"title\":\"Value\"}},\"required\":[\"value\"],\"title\":\"BoundCaseCitation\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRangeRead\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"end_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"End Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"source_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^S[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Source Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"Start Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"source_ref\",\"start_char\",\"end_char\"],\"title\":\"BoundRangeRead\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundReadRequest\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^C[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Case Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"difference_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^D[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Difference Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"ranges\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRangeRead\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Ranges\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"segment_refs\":{\"items\":{\"pattern\":\"^P[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":100,\"title\":\"Segment Refs\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"title\":\"BoundReadRequest\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRuleCandidate\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"applicability_suggestion\":{\"default\":\"unknown\",\"enum\":[\"unknown\",\"current\",\"future\"],\"title\":\"Applicability Suggestion\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"case_impacts\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCandidate\"},\"title\":\"Case Impacts\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"document_citations\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundTextCitation\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Document Citations\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"key\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Key\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"added\",\"modified\",\"removed\",\"uncertain\"],\"title\":\"Kind\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Reason\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"summary\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"uncertainties\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":\"Uncertainties\",\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"key\",\"kind\",\"summary\",\"reason\",\"document_citations\"],\"title\":\"BoundRuleCandidate\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundRuleCaseAssessment\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"case_impacts\":{\"items\":{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundCaseCandidate\"},\"minItems\":1,\"title\":\"Case Impacts\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"rule_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^R[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Rule Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"rule_ref\",\"case_impacts\"],\"title\":\"BoundRuleCaseAssessment\",\"type\":\"object\"},\"BoundTextCitation\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"end_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"End Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"quote\":{\"minLength\":1,\"title\":\"Quote\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source_ref\":{\"pattern\":\"^S[1-9][0-9]*$\",\"title\":\"Source Ref\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_char\":{\"minimum\":0,\"title\":\"Start Char\",\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"source_ref\",\"start_char\",\"end_char\",\"quote\"],\"title\":\"BoundTextCitation\",\"type\":\"object\"}},\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"action\":{\"enum\":[\"read\",\"finish\"],\"title\":\"Action\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"candidates\":{\"items\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRuleCandidate\"},{\"$ref\":\"#/$defs/BoundRuleCaseAssessment\"}]},\"title\":\"Candidates\",\"type\":\"array\"},\"p